[{"title":"马侍御见访山中 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"一辞金马籍，甘老白云岑。\n喜子今持斧，怜予此盍簪。\n各天晤不数，末路契逾深。\n徙倚庭前树，栖乌欲满林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖泛","author":"王廷陈","text":"楚地饶洲渚，骚人恋芰荷。\n鹢舟张锦席，龙笛起沧波。\n鸟影随樯影，渔歌入棹歌。\n前溪闻更好，欲进暮烟多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过诸子书屋寄虞文表","author":"王廷陈","text":"三礼传非谬，诸生仰独深。\n偶经伐木地，徒有折麻心。\n雪调朱弦尽，星文宝剑沉。\n怜君困已久，梁父自长吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园酌谢子 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"待汝频扳桂，怜予久系匏。\n无嫌一日长，愿结百年交。\n启户惊黄叶，开尊藉白茅。\n自无奇可问，何怪世人嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园酌谢子 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"儿童操翰墨，四十且无成。\n自汝工诸体，令予畏后生。\n吾里中丞裔，前朝太傅名。\n高才有如此，真不愧家声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园酌谢子 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"我舅为生祖，生名较我嘉。\n忘年称小友，累世属通家。\n王谢贤非乏，园庐路不遐。\n逼衰偏笃旧，数见惜年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友人","author":"王廷陈","text":"之子镇南荒，威名万里扬。\n经年闻选士，计日欲擒王。\n神武元无战，佳兵乃不祥。\n寄言投笔者，何事乐开疆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜舒郑二子夜过","author":"王廷陈","text":"寒景沈江阁，繁星缀石林。\n一时来二子，散帙复鸣琴。\n高价真连璧，深盟可断金。\n从今三径熟，携手数相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑生","author":"王廷陈","text":"郑生才可怜，白首困江边。\n长夏自饶睡，穷途人馈钱。\n相过夜不厌，与语日堪延。\n共试山家茗，呼儿行汲泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯太守席上留别","author":"王廷陈","text":"汉室冯公伟，为郎岁月饶。\n一麾烦出守，白首竟谁招。\n初雨传觞日，微凉秉烛宵。\n相看意无限，明惜马蹄遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上送张子二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"天风忽然至，吹地转蓬科。\n别泪随江水，离声杂棹歌。\n花时临赤壁，雁候渡黄河。\n京室怀予处，长搴旧薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上送张子二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"他时怀大士，何地望京华。\n词赋留香草，衣裳见紫霞。\n天边今朔雁，泽畔已秋花。\n归路冲寒色，翻思楚客家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢氏宅夜集","author":"王廷陈","text":"过尔通宵宴，留人乐事繁。\n诗题芸草室，觞到菊花轩。\n月落城乌起，霜寒枥马喧。\n醉来聊隐几，旭日散柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边二客过访","author":"王廷陈","text":"白露窥枫浦，苍苔上石门。\n人稀檐雀下，草冷砌虫喧。\n竹里开三径，花间倒一尊。\n从今延二仲，相与乐丘园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过十一叔庄","author":"王廷陈","text":"陶潜耽漉酒，阮籍好鸣琴。\n沙雁冲人起，山蝉傍马吟。\n高秋花是菊，僻地竹为林。\n醉后迷归路，苍茫下夕阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻曹子仲礼缘近臣之疏蒙恩赐还","author":"王廷陈","text":"窜逐南天路，荒凉北斗文。\n翻飞元不意，忧喜在初闻。\n骢马重趋阙，金鸡两赦君。\n独伤荆棘里，谁别凤鸾群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21618,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病后饮十一叔宅同诸兄弟","author":"王廷陈","text":"川云流苑细，楼月照筵新。\n弄玉元秦女，淩波本洛神。\n竹林明积雪，池草暗生春。\n骨肉情亲夜，深杯慰采薪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边即事呈友人四首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"岁晚人犹隔，汀寒昼不哗。\n松门当远岫，竹槛俯平沙。\n鹭宿依冰片，鸥飞乱雪花。\n如闻子猷棹，乘兴到山家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边即事呈友人四首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"空斋滩响入，塌岸水痕除。\n竹杪喧檐马，芸边走壁鱼。\n门无题凤字，村有卧龙庐。\n曲巷寒门里，空传长者车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21621,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边即事呈友人四首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"推窗迎峤立，垂钓凿冰开。\n未叶先生柳，馀花处士梅。\n鸟从烟里度，人向雪中来。\n暝色青溪上，缘君首重回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21622,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边即事呈友人四首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"佳景每自惬，幽期孰与论。\n林开延岫色，沙圮灭溪痕。\n洗药穿松叶，移尊傍竹根。\n江山待词客，几杖向谁门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21623,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李国宾宅留别","author":"王廷陈","text":"汝拜朝正表，予留谒帝居。\n经年思凤吹，几度寄鱼书。\n患难谊逾笃，流连哀未除。\n行吟恐憔悴，他日吊三闾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21624,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾医","author":"王廷陈","text":"潦倒文园客，淹留顾虎头。\n我看方士传，君向古人求。\n药裹春心满，风帆晚浪收。\n匡庐傍南斗，归作采芝游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21625,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈鲁南太史使楚还晤予江上因赠三首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"校书辞汉阁，持节到江城。\n万乘临轩送，诸侯拥彗迎。\n王人周室礼，神女楚台情。\n词赋兼文物，知无负此行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21626,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈鲁南太史使楚还晤予江上因赠三首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"睦族遵尧典，亲臣践楚郊。\n北门虚视草，赤社重分茅。\n不以云泥隔，犹怜江海交。\n皇华劳藉慰，玄困任人嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21627,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈鲁南太史使楚还晤予江上因赠三首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"何意大江滨，苍茫接所亲。\n相看鬒已变，转盼迹俱陈。\n子是浮湘客，予为哀郢人。\n严程不我驻，临路倍沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21628,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶出","author":"王廷陈","text":"偃蹇苍岩畔，沿回碧水湾。\n鸣琴林竹下，洗帻岛藤间。\n是处云留卧，馀生天与閒。\n徘徊山径里，指点暮禽还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"进舸","author":"王廷陈","text":"进舸清秋暮，吟风锦树开。\n前凫冲棹散，后雁逐帆来。\n石出滩声转，沙明月色回。\n欲知临泛永，试看曙光催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访童内方太史于汉口舟中即席投赠二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"汉广来非偶，人遐会亦奇。\n独趋金马去，暂遣白鸥随。\n泛舸疑牛渚，弹冠想凤池。\n当怜泽畔侣，憔悴不胜悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访童内方太史于汉口舟中即席投赠二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"每忆朝端旧，宁期汉上逢。\n举杯酹鹦鹉，吹笛拥鱼龙。\n天远江俱尽，枫回渚自重。\n知君欲解䌫，为我且从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴曾氏园亭即事遂成艳曲二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"宾客醉华堂，情亲向曲房。\n佳人牵架蔓，稚子搦池杨。\n风起青蘋末，云生锦石傍。\n勿云天日暮，银烛散朱光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴曾氏园亭即事遂成艳曲二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"曲榭恣夤缘，名园更接连。\n引枝分槛果，拨藻数盆鲜。\n醉舞花低户，娇歌莺近筵。\n尽教欢乐极，莫负艳阳天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐庭前栖鸟乍惊","author":"王廷陈","text":"侧识安巢意，那堪绕树悲。\n风寒难自稳，月白更须疑。\n乌鹊仍三匝，鹪鹩但一枝。\n卑栖复如此，何有上林思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘氏双挽","author":"王廷陈","text":"蒿里风云变，松丘岁月深。\n剑埋龙并逝，箫去凤俱沉。\n郁郁楸梧气，悠悠伏腊心。\n承家看令子，壮节比南金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄杨太常","author":"王廷陈","text":"屈宋流传古，丘园道路赊。\n湘潭题杜若，源水问桃花。\n黑发违朱绂，青山卧綵霞。\n春霄目归雁，早晚惠瑶华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游武昌江龙盘矶寺","author":"王廷陈","text":"巨石表江心，花宫傍太阴。\n天寒龙卧稳，云迥雁飞深。\n栋宇飘明镜，汀洲响梵音。\n慈航向夕渡，转觉恋祗林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客夜宴舟中","author":"王廷陈","text":"宵岸移星舸，秋尊款月扉。\n弄珠疑汉女，鼓瑟忆湘妃。\n听曲鱼龙出，撩筵鸥鹭飞。\n天寒不觉醉，斗转未言归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王洪德入蜀","author":"王廷陈","text":"落落幽并客，栖栖荆楚颜。\n遥知问卜去，或是泛槎还。\n云雨经三峡，风烟犯百蛮。\n看君壮游志，去矣杳难攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张子鱼过访","author":"王廷陈","text":"故人天上至，清宴夜深开。\n泽畔微芳度，江皋暝色回。\n枫林停翠幰，月岸拥金罍。\n正苦欢娱逼，无令候吏催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送傅子归豫章","author":"王廷陈","text":"岁宴向何处，云之故国天。\n行当腊雪尽，归及春风前。\n片帆九江影，瀑布庐山泉。\n送君何所托，为吊石滩贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚眺","author":"王廷陈","text":"眺迥临高阁，江湘万里馀。\n草边云梦猎，花下武陵渔。\n白日山川气，清秋水竹居。\n仙踪同霸业，消歇总愁予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21643,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过邵子草堂","author":"王廷陈","text":"觅径依林薄，传杯竟夜分。\n曲堤盘古月，老树宿寒云。\n室静江鸣彻，山空鬼啸闻。\n倦来吾谢去，明发过论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21644,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上赠罗汝延太守","author":"王廷陈","text":"君今握印绶，吾已息柴荆。\n雪舸寒初系，风汀晚更鸣。\n云霄五马贵，江海一鸥轻。\n赠子以何物，中洲揽杜蘅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21645,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中喜涂生数来","author":"王廷陈","text":"念子贫到骨，佯狂颇自贤。\n未辞东郭履，频泛剡溪船。\n弹铗竟不遇，吹箫古有然。\n蛟龙本神物，变化知何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21646,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕渡访友人","author":"王廷陈","text":"暝色满晴川，幽人何处边。\n山腰翻落照，水面没遥天。\n贾爨滩烟合，渔归岸火悬。\n剡溪今夜棹，乘兴未言旋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21647,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登武昌西山绝顶二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"昔望怀徒积，今登气益雄。\n壶觞飞鸟外，几杖入云中。\n地引江湖尽，天含涧壑空。\n壮心殊未巳，浩啸倚长风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21648,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登武昌西山绝顶二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"山迥人跻倦，云长鸟去迟。\n天中倾竹叶，日下把松枝。\n石想吴王剑，城吟谢客诗。\n醉归临渡处，应与夕阳期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21649,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿龙蟠矶寺中","author":"王廷陈","text":"龙象开灵屿，鼋鼍戴法筵。\n石间攒宝树，镜里涌红莲。\n香气潭烟接，灯光岸火连。\n禅房风浪逼，永夜不成眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21650,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨渡望龙蟠寺","author":"王廷陈","text":"石拔烟霞抱，舟回浦溆通。\n楼台疑蜃市，钟鼓识龙宫。\n宝树萦波上，金花落镜中。\n何时登彼岸，一洗世缘空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21651,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄上富顺王殿下","author":"王廷陈","text":"南国诸王馆，池亭独有名。\n楚风蘋末劲，淮月桂丛明。\n中物酲先析，当天晕已生。\n无令为善乐，专美汉东平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21652,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠西阳子二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"西阳谈道术，冬日尚絺衣。\n启户欢晴旭，无衾惮夕晖。\n黄金惭不就，白发欲何归。\n饥饿朝来迫，蓬头叩我扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21653,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠西阳子二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"未试餐霞术，空传煮石方。\n三旬凡九食，颜面颇仓皇。\n灰冷烧丹鼎，香馀卖药囊。\n严寒君少畏，岁已逼青阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21654,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日山居即事五首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"瓜地斜侵浦，茅堂曲抱山。\n琴书青竹里，枕簟绿萝间。\n累日头无栉，浮云心自閒。\n交游渐稀少，双户昼长关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21655,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日山居即事五首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"筑室清溪曲，为园古道傍。\n苔痕侵户牖，云色上衣裳。\n牧笛依青草，渔舟隐绿杨。\n偶然幽兴惬，搔首放歌长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21656,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日山居即事五首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"系舸篱傍树，开渠槛外流。\n竹烟藏晓嶂，花气覆春洲。\n玄鸟营巢至，阴虫逐侣游。\n生涯堪放浪，何必世人求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21657,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日山居即事五首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"野旷林争出，花深径屡回。\n春风芳草上，乱水白云隈。\n燕接飞虫去，莺沾落絮来。\n小堂宜竹护，一一荷锄栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21658,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁酉之夏觏文溪子于大江之滨与之述往感时命酒坐石挥涕而别太息成诗","author":"王廷陈","text":"怆尔离群久，艰危更可伤。\n一麾堪白首，万死出南荒。\n天入潇湘阔，风惊鹳鹤扬。\n垂堂古有戒，去矣慎舟航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21659,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李袁两生过饮","author":"王廷陈","text":"驾枉潜夫室，堂开上客筵。\n虽吾丈人行，愧汝两生贤。\n春去伤花艳，年来倦草玄。\n吁嗟老将至，何以使名传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21660,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"王廷陈","text":"晴日丽芳洲，春风振碧流。\n灵均兰可揽，神女佩堪留。\n渔岂临渊羡，仙因入海求。\n机心息已久，自喜不惊鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21661,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪子 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"忆当武庙末，并上汉庭书。\n放逐时皆散，音容日以疏。\n诸君不远复，独我遂幽居。\n铩羽当年侣，翻飞迥不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21662,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪子 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"不合辄投簪，高踪众所钦。\n波流奋独往，海峤发孤吟。\n虽滞秦稽迹，犹县魏阙心。\n徵书行且至，栖遁不宜深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21663,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪子 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"自免一何勇，邴生诚我师。\n可为智者道，聊惬幽人期。\n岁月任公钓，登临谢客诗。\n肯令沧海岸，重勒北山移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21664,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪子 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"群公方议进，吾子独初衣。\n即市称大隐，于星应少微。\n鹏图无近适，凤览有馀辉。\n高士逝已久，非君谁与归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21665,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪子 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"自尔稽山卧，风猷较古多。\n名流掩王谢，游客结羊何。\n洲岛冯轩得，云霞岸帻哦。\n颇嗔冠盖访，不厌野人过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21666,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠邦伯吴公","author":"王廷陈","text":"予慕古循吏，人称新使君。\n虽然改弦鼓，不以治丝棼。\n退食溪毛饫，公庭鸟毳纷。\n良哉二千石，名已汉皇闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21667,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友有被谤而褫其官者诗以慰之","author":"王廷陈","text":"省已良非过，于人乃不孚。\n文身弃章甫，按剑对明珠。\n去位宾朋散，还家儋石无。\n孔颜亦偃蹇，汝困勿嗟吁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21668,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"王廷陈","text":"万事不复理，此生从所之。\n自知心匪石，谁念鬓成丝。\n得失事非偶，驰驱数已奇。\n虽然罢通籍，饱饭亦恩私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21669,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"王廷陈","text":"深居懒出村，习静欲忘言。\n岫苦云霞变，溪憎雁鹜喧。\n达生聊可托，智者始堪论。\n久绝青云想，从教白发繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21670,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观涨","author":"王廷陈","text":"孤屿崇朝失，平畴一瞬深。\n室庐沦水府，网罟入云林。\n实想轻舟济，虚疑陆地沉。\n敢兴微禹叹，侧识警尧心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21671,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]